        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {d ^ {2}}{d t ^ {2}} r (t) + 3 \\frac {d}{d t} r (t) + 2 r (t) = \\frac {d}{d t} e (t) + 3 e (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            319,
            157,
            673,
            191
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若激励信号和起始状态为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            197,
            388,
            211
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ne (t) = u (t), r (0) = 1, r ^ {\\prime} (0) = 2\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            374,
            223,
            621,
            239
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "试求它的完全响应，并指出其自由响应、强迫响应。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            245,
            594,
            262
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【新增，根据25年成都信息工程大学改变】",
        "bbox": [
            189,
            502,
            536,
            517
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知一 LTIS 的微分方程 $y''(t)+5y'(t)+6y(t)=2f'(t)+f(t)$ ，且已知输入 $f(t)=e^{-t}u(t)$ ， $y(0)=1, y'(0)=1$ ，求系统完全响应。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            524,
            811,
            572
        ],
        "page_idx": 7
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
