            423,
            556,
            439
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $f(t)=u(t)$ ; 经过5步后得解为 $\\frac{1}{6}$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            447,
            475,
            470
        ],
        "page_idx": 8
    },
    {
