    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + a _ {1} y ^ {\\prime} (t) + a _ {0} y (t) = x ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 3 x ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 x (t)\n$$",
